codex
The parsed mismatch is not a hardware mismatch: `parse_spike_commits()` subtracts `pc_base` from any Spike writeback in `[0x1000, 0x11000)`. That transforms Spike’s real `0x0000d000` into `0x0000c000`, creating the reported divergence. I’m switching the riscv-dv runner away from that broad writeback normalization for this seed path, then I’ll re-run to see the real next divergence.
