codex
A blanket `normalize_wdata_base=False` would regress earlier address materialization (`la user_stack_end` uses `auipc`, Spike writes `0x70c2`, DUT writes normalized `0x60c2`). I’m making the normalizer taint-aware instead: normalize writebacks derived from PC-relative address formation, but do not normalize an unrelated `C.LUI` constant like `0xd000`.
apply patch
